playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302110/extras/690491e3837cb5a3146e44b4f83e6e80.poster.avif?t=1728893907\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302110/extras/690491e3837cb5a3146e44b4f83e6e80.webm?t=1728893907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302110/extras/690491e3837cb5a3146e44b4f83e6e80.mp4?t=1728893907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>HPE Dragon</u> - Intimidating to drive and to race, what HPE\u2019s high-performance Dragon lacks in subtlety and manoeuvrability, it more than makes up for it in raw power and top speed.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302110/extras/d59e4c9ab592ade070ad6a13d1986392.poster.avif?t=1728893907\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302110/extras/d59e4c9ab592ade070ad6a13d1986392.webm?t=1728893907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302110/extras/d59e4c9ab592ade070ad6a13d1986392.mp4?t=1728893907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
